{"id":16,"titleZh":"什么是印象派？","titleEn":"What Is Impressionism?","date":"1961-11-23","dateZh":"1961 年 11 月 23 日","concepts":"暗示与光影、全音阶、叠加延伸和弦、复调性","thesis":"印象派不追求雕刻清晰硬朗的线条，而是靠漂浮的全音阶和双调性叠加，调动耳朵去捕捉光影和氛围。","plain":"想描摹大海的光影与微风，写实照片反而不如莫奈的朦胧油画。德彪西与拉威尔舍弃了传统大小调清晰的“回家感”，改用上下无明确主音的全音阶、高叠延伸和弦以及两个调性同时并奏，营造闪烁漂浮的听觉画面。","scenes":["屏幕并排展示莫奈《卢昂大教堂》画作与实景照片作对比；伯恩斯坦先重弹贝多芬《第五》刚硬命令式的动机，再切入德彪西《帆》飘忽的全音阶音阶对照。","用钢琴大特写拆分大调音阶与全音阶，现场故意左右手同时以两个不同调性弹《蓝色多瑙河》演示复调性，随后乐团演完德彪西《大海》全篇与拉威尔《达夫尼斯与克洛埃》。"],"category":"基础乐理","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1qJ41147oF","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qJ41147oF","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 什么是印象派","duration":"55:18","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/what-is-impressionism","repertoire":[{"composer":"Debussy","piece":"La Mer","titleZh":"大海（三乐章全曲）","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Debussy%20La%20Mer+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Debussy%20La%20Mer"},{"composer":"Debussy","piece":"Voiles from Préludes, Book I","titleZh":"前奏曲：帆","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/8c/a9/72/8ca97231-7a25-2c19-a376-75e3f7871e32/mzaf_9266042614364970141.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/pr%C3%A9ludes-book-1-2-voiles/1452507592?i=1452510700&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Pascal Rogé","recordingTrack":"Préludes - Book 1: 2. Voiles","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Debussy%20Voiles%20from%20Pr%C3%A9ludes%2C%20Book%20I+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Debussy%20Voiles%20from%20Pr%C3%A9ludes%2C%20Book%20I"},{"composer":"Debussy","piece":"Poissons d'or from Images, Set II","titleZh":"意象集：金鱼","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/r